01:01:43,333 --> 01:01:49,333
It is based on the 1952 short story of the same name by Ray Bradbury.

12
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:26,000
The film stars Edward Burns, Catherine McCormack, and Ben Kingsley.

13
01:12:56,666 --> 01:13:02,666
It follows "time tourists" who accidentally interfere too much
with the past, completely altering the present.

14
01:18:33,333 --> 01:18:39,333
A Sound of Thunder was released in the United States
on September 2, 2005, by Warner Bros.

15
01:24:10,000 --> 01:24:16,000
The film failed at the box office, earning only $11.8 million against a production budget of $80 million, and was largely panned by critics, who criticized
its cheap special effects, uninvolved performances, scientific errors and choppy logic, and the lack of faithfulness to the source material.

